:: Start
<<nobr>>
    <div class="titleParent">
        <p class="titleTop">Welcome to</p>
        <p class="titleBottom">The Last Approach</p>
    </div>
    <div class="buttonsParent">
        <div class="button">
            [[Let the fun begin!->tutorial1]]
        </div>
    </div>
<</nobr>>


:: tutorial1
<<nobr>>
    <div class="storyContainer">
        <div class="Subtitle">
            <p>Tutorial - 1</p>
        </div>
        <div class="StoryMain">
            <p>Welcome to my "non-linear" adventure game.</p>
            <br>
            <p>In this game, you will be asked a series of question, which you will need to answer, in order to achieve success.</p>
            <br>
            <p>However, every decision will have consequences. You will not know the result immediately, however at the end you will clearly understand why your choices mattered.</p>
            <br>
            <p>You can navigate the story using the buttons above. But remember, no take backsies!</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="buttonsParent">
        <div class="button">
            [[Introduction->introduction]]
        </div>
    </div>
<</nobr>>

:: introduction
<<nobr>>
    <div class="storyContainer">
        <div class="Subtitle">
            <p>Introduction - 1</p>
        </div>
        <div class="StoryMain">
            <p>Below you will have a quick brief on your character: </p>
            <br>
            <hr>
            <p>Name: -TBD- </p>
            <p>Age: -TBD- </p>
            <p>Gender: -TBD- </p>
            <p>Nationality: Icelander </p>
            <p>Reason for travel: Family reunion</p>
            <hr>
            <br>
            <p>When ready, click the button above to begin your adventure!</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="buttonsParent">
        <div class="button">
            [[Chapter 1->Chapter1.0]]
        </div>
    </div>
<</nobr>>
